# Bugbot policy

Use Cursor Bugbot **selectively** — not every PR, not a default checklist item.

## Invoke when

- ✅ High-risk change (contracts, solver invariants, authority/doc routing)
- ✅ Large diff or cross-cutting refactor
- ✅ User explicitly requests Bugbot review
- ✅ Uncertain regression surface after merge

## Skip when

- ❌ Docs-only PR, no runtime path change — skip Bugbot
- ❌ Narrow test/style fix with green CI — skip Bugbot
- ❌ User asked to skip automated review

## Agent rule

Don't add "run Bugbot" to PR templates or completion checklists by default. Mention Bugbot only when an invoke criterion applies.
